<title>INDIA: Cricket-India beat Australia by seven wickets.</title>
<headline>Cricket-India beat Australia by seven wickets.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>India defeated Australia by seven wickets on the fourth day of their single cricket test at the Feroze Shah Kotla ground on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Australia 182 and 234. India 361 and 58-3</p>
</text>
